(:decision
  :id "D47"
  :shortcode "D47"
  :title "Codebase Lexical Token Profiler, Hotspot Forensic Audit, and Rational Boundary Compaction Paradigm"
  :status "active"
  :date "2026-09-09"
  :cluster "architecture/governance"
  :deciders ["architect" "planner" "implementer" "auditor"]
  :problemStatement "As codebases evolve, identifiers and keywords accumulate verbose multi-token English compounds (string-contains? [4 tok], string-starts-with? [5 tok], string-from-int64 [5 tok], :rationale [3 tok]), violating the 1-to-2 token basis (c4, d46). Furthermore, AI agents lack resident tooling to profile token distribution, identify token monsters, locate file hotspots, and apply deterministic compaction rules across arbitrary projects."
  :decisionDrivers [
    "Full-Spectrum Token Auditing: resident tool capable of scanning all ASL and ASN files in single sub-second pass"
    "Multi-Dimensional Decomposition: global metrics, file hotspots, token monsters, and recurring collocations"
    "Rational Boundary & Local Autonomy (d34): distinguishing wire boundary protocols from local domain internals"
    "Concrete Compaction Modalities & 1-to-2 Token Aliases (txt/*, v/*, opt/*, str/*)"
    "Cross-Project Portability: self-contained executable rules applicable to any ASL/ASN repository"
  ]
  :decision "Implement full-codebase multi-dimensional token profiling in asl-engine (:tokens :mode \"all\") and CLI (asl tokens --all, asl tokens --paradigm); formalize the Rational Boundary Compaction Paradigm; calibrate and audit across all 995 files in the monorepo; and verify under monorepo gate."
  :invariants [
    "c1"
    "c2"
    "c3"
    "c4"
    "d34"
    "d46"
  ]
  :consequences [
    (:consequence :type :positive :details "Enables instant full-repository token profiling across 995 files in under 2 seconds")
    (:consequence :type :positive :details "Identifies exact file hotspots, token monsters (>= 3 tokens), and recurring 2-gram collocations")
    (:consequence :type :positive :details "Calculates potential token savings (21,902 tokens across monorepo) and suggests modular 1-to-2 token aliases")
    (:consequence :type :positive :details "Embeds the Rational Boundary Compaction Paradigm directly into CLI for standalone adoption in external projects")
    (:consequence :type :negative :details "Requires periodic codebase auditing during release cycles to maintain low token debt")
  ]
)
